WEBVTT

00:00:29.984 --> 00:00:33.571
but he was unable to do so
because he was illiterate.

00:00:34.989 --> 00:00:39.577
He didn't have Sugi's birth certificate
or any of her photographs.

00:00:41.037 --> 00:00:43.873
So, the police didn't believe him,

00:00:43.873 --> 00:00:45.041
and did nothing.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.047
He tried, again and again, but no luck.

00:00:52.423 --> 00:00:54.675
It was as if Sugi never existed.

00:00:56.344 --> 00:00:58.054
Ten years later,

00:00:58.054 --> 00:01:02.100
a local nonprofit
that fights human trafficking